    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/physiotherapy-clinic/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Physiotherapy Clinic is a specialized and user-friendly theme designed for physiotherapy clinics, wellness centers, rehabilitation facilities, chiropractors, yoga classes, medical practitioners, and therapy centers looking to establish a professional online presence. Perfect for promoting physiotherapy services, health treatments, pain relief programs, fitness therapy, patient care, and recovery plans, this theme provides a clean, intuitive, and responsive layout that works seamlessly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Key features include sections for clinic services, staff profiles, success stories, multimedia galleries, and integrated appointment booking forms to streamline patient scheduling. The theme supports customization of colors, fonts, and layouts to match your clinic’s branding, while its SEO-friendly codebase improves online visibility. Optimized for speed and performance, it ensures fast-loading pages and smooth user experience. With one-click demo import, easy content setup, and compatibility with Contact Form 7 for patient inquiries, Physiotherapy Clinic offers a professional, fully-featured platform to attract more patients, showcase expertise, and enhance your healthcare services online. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/physiotherapy-clinic/"
    },
